528
00:28:37,590 --> 00:28:39,450
Ini satu-satunya kesempatanku.

529
00:28:40,720 --> 00:28:41,680
Jika berhasil,

530
00:28:42,070 --> 00:28:43,880
Wenqian baru akan memiliki
secercah harapan.

531
00:28:43,880 --> 00:28:45,030
Hua dan Keluarga Li,

532
00:28:45,030 --> 00:28:46,750
baru bisa melewati bencana ini.

533
00:28:46,750 --> 00:28:48,410
Aku tidak punya pilihan lain.

534
00:28:53,510 --> 00:28:54,510
Kak Cuiqiao.

535
00:28:55,960 --> 00:28:58,020
Aku hanya bisa mengambil risiko ini.

536
00:29:04,160 --> 00:29:05,000
Nak.

537
00:29:05,720 --> 00:29:06,720
Para paman,

538
00:29:07,000 --> 00:29:08,160
kalian bersedia membantu Tinta Li,

539
00:29:08,160 --> 00:29:09,400
Zhen sangat berterima kasih.

540
00:29:09,400 --> 00:29:11,310
Zhen dengan ini memberikan hormat.

541
00:29:11,310 --> 00:29:12,000
Ini...

542
00:29:12,790 --> 00:29:13,550
Nak.

543
00:29:13,880 --> 00:29:15,350
Keluarga Tian sudah sangat jahat.

544
00:29:15,350 --> 00:29:16,510
Keluarga Li mengalami bencana ini,

545
00:29:16,510 --> 00:29:18,640
