697
00:34:36,880 --> 00:34:38,139
sangatlah tidak adil.

698
00:34:39,030 --> 00:34:41,150
Aku berharap Tuan Prefek
melaporkan ke istana,

699
00:34:41,150 --> 00:34:43,150
